      "writtenOn": "2025-10-13T19:15:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure what you\u0027re telling me. You want me to upload `Texture` CLs with no tests first and then separately add `WriteTexture` support? My path was, \"make a test\", then \"make it pass\". Without a test, I have no idea if the code I wrote was the correct code to write. So just adding a support for `Texture` gives no context since there\u0027s no proof it works. Since we only capture what\u0027s used I needed a way to use a texture in order to test `Texture`. `WriteTexture` was the simplest way to use a texture.",
